                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Insurance regulation has been left to the states for \u2b06\ufe0f 150 yrs. In the wake of the Federal Insurance Office\u2019s climate data call, I intro'd legislation to take away their subpoena authority.\u00a0I'm pleased to see FIO finally working with state regulators after initial refusal.",
