                "quoted_status_profile_username": "FinancialCmte",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Federal Insurance Office has grown increasingly aggressive in collecting data from insurance companies. This bill repeals the FIO's coercive subpoena powers and implements additional data privacy safeguards to assure the public that their data is not being mishandled.",
