                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am honored to receive the PIA Legislator of the Year Award! As a member of @FinancialCmte I\u2019ve had an opportunity to be more hands on in defending state-based insurance regulation and helping grow Wisconsin\u2019s insurance industry. I look forward to continuing this important work. https://t.co/sZG9KWlmbY",
