                "text": "Proud to support FY25 NDAA - it reflects Congress's commitment to our troops & families: a 14.5% pay raise for junior enlisted troops, better housing, expanded childcare, & improved healthcare. These steps honor their sacrifices and strengthen military readiness and retention.",
