                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": ".@GovEvers is wrong, as usual. He stands against the vast majority of Wisconsinites who oppose benefits for illegal aliens and able-bodied adults without work requirements. Wisconsin's Medicaid program is going to work better for children, pregnant women, the disabled, and the elderly by ending system waste, fraud, and abuse. House Republicans provided Wisconsin with a historic investment of at least $500 million for rural hospitals. This investment paired with ending taxes on tips and overtime for hard-working Wisconsinites will improve the lives of those living in our state.",
