                "text": "Fixed it for you, @GovEvers.\n\nIt\u2019s day 29 of the Democrat shutdown & @SenateDems have voted against reopening the government 13 TIMES. Why? Because they care more about taxpayer-funded healthcare for illegal aliens than funding SNAP, paying our military & air traffic controllers.",
