                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 14,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Let\u2019s be clear about what\u2019s really happening. The government is shut down because Democrats are demanding billions of new taxpayer dollars to prop up the failed system of Obamacare and because they want to reinstate taxpayer-funded healthcare for illegal aliens. They\u2019re using this false \u201cpremium hike\u201d story as an excuse to keep the government closed because Republicans in Washington are doing exactly what the American people elected us to do.\n\nThe facts are simple: those COVID-era subsidies were always temporary. Democrats voted to include the sunset THEMSELVES when they passed the Inflation Reduction Act in 2022 with all Democrat votes. Those subsidies kept costs artificially low, and now prices are simply returning to where they would have been without that short-term, taxpayer-funded boost.\n\nI\u2019m open to a real conversation about reforming our healthcare system and lowering costs, but that has to start with serious, structural changes to the existing system. We can\u2019t keep writing blank checks for a program that\u2019s heavily subsidized and keeps costs high.\n\nRead my op-ed in the Milwaukee Journal Sentinel \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/jmcsq8BiLt",
